OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with assaults during
OL,4,AGlasgow Green protests disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged over a number of
OL,7,Fassaults during disorder on Glasgow
OL,8,FGreen in July involving
OL,9,Fanti-immigration and anti-racism
OL,10,Fcampaigners.
OL,12,FThe 31-year-old is accused of four
OL,13,Fassaults, including with an offensive
OL,14,Fweapon and "endangerment to life", and
OL,15,Fwith a separate charge of breach of the
OL,16,Fpeace.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
