OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with assaults during
OL,4,AGlasgow Green protests disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe becomes the 17th person charged over
OL,7,Fthe scenes on 25 July, when rival
OL,8,Fgroups of demonstrators clashed and
OL,9,Fsome attendees carried out what police
OL,10,Fdescribed as a rampage through the
OL,11,Fcity.
OL,13,FVideo from the scene showed scuffles
OL,14,Fand police drawing their batons to
OL,15,Fcontain protesters, with further
OL,16,Ftrouble occurring in the city centre
OL,17,Flater, including Oswald Street being
OL,18,Fsealed off.
